+## Technical Notes
+
+### Torch Dependency Issue
+
+**Problem:** `build_dynamic_prompt.py` imports `superprompter` which requires PyTorch
+**Solution:** Created `build_dynamic_prompt_minimal.py` that skips superprompter import
